    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "Three friends, Cam, Holly and Seb, share a prize of $\\$750$ in the ratio $3:4:8$.\nHow much more money does Seb receive than Cam?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\$250$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(3+4+8)\\text{ parts}&=15\\text{ parts}\\\\15\\text{ parts}&=\\$750\\\\1\\text{ part}&=\\$750\\div15=\\$50\\\\\\text{Difference in parts}&=8-3=5\\\\5\\text{ parts}&=5\\times\\$50=\\$250\\end{align*}$$\nSeb receives $\\$250$ more than Cam.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
